[h2]内容范围[/h2]
本次安装包含5579个贴图绑定，较上一版增加262个；全库存5481个独立人物来源已审通过，另有4个非人物例外保留原图；本包按DLC路径优先级选用5398个人物来源。游戏贴图与其原版来源分辨率一致，高清生成原件完整保留。当前1.19.4.1库存共5488个独立来源，其中此次新发现的3个人物来源暂沿用游戏原图；748条历史未解析引用继续记录。上方截图来自2026-10-30的旧安装包，只证明当时已抽查位置，不代表新增素材或全部角色、事件和DLC组合已实机遍历。其他头像模组可能覆盖相同资源，请优先单独启用本模组测试。

[hr][/hr]
[h2]A little kindness in a strategy game[/h2]
[b]A character portrait mod for Hearts of Iron IV, with individual clothing, hair and poses preserved.[/b]

Hearts of Nailong gradually replaces real-person portraits that may carry real-world controversy with the friendly, harmless Nailong mascot. Clothing, hair, facial hair, poses and other visible details help each character retain an individual appearance.

This is a small creative wish for peace: oppose racial discrimination, respect human dignity, and keep differences of nationality, ethnicity and history from turning into hostility between players. We hope people from different backgrounds can share a laugh and enjoy a strategy game together. Cute portraits cannot solve real conflicts, but they can remind us to treat one another with kindness.

[h2]Keep fiction and reality distinct[/h2]
Countries, wars, characters and alternate paths in the game belong to its fictional experience. Gameplay choices and victories do not justify discrimination, hatred or the glorification of real harm. Please maintain a clear boundary between play and reality, respect fellow players, and avoid projecting fictional rivalries onto real communities.

[h2]Actual gameplay and current scope[/h2]
The images above are genuine screenshots from the rebuilt mod: France was played through 4 January 1936; the UK and USA were inspected in fresh starts. They are not AI-generated gameplay scenes.

This package contains 5,579 texture bindings, 262 more than the previous package. The full inventory has 5,481 individually reviewed character sources; this package selects 5,398 character sources and four preserved non-person exceptions according to DLC path precedence. Game textures retain their original source dimensions and HD originals are archived unchanged. The current 1.19.4.1 inventory contains 5,488 unique sources; three newly discovered character sources retain original game art and 748 historical unresolved references remain documented. Screenshots above come from the old package on 30 October 2026; they do not establish live acceptance of every new portrait or all characters, events and DLC combinations. Portrait mods replacing the same resources may conflict; test this mod on its own first.
